# Store every file exactly as committed. Many files carry CRLF line endings (the CSV
# files written with Python's csv module, and the three .hoc files in
# Neuron_Test/R859C/), and the figure scripts are checked by regenerating these files
# byte for byte, so no line-ending conversion may happen on any platform.
* -text

# Binary formats, so that diffs and merges never try to treat them as text.
*.pdf  binary
*.npz  binary
*.npy  binary
*.pbz2 binary
